{"ID":"20240118151252-n931po7","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151252-n931po7","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151252-n931po7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151252-8av4wq8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240130092415-rvkdl9i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240130092415-rvkdl9i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"099榆皮（榆白皮）","type":"doc","updated":"20240130092415"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151252-8av4wq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151252-8av4wq8","updated":"20240122104353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本草原文】味甘平，主大小便不通，利水道，除邪气，久服轻身不饥。今名榆白皮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122104357-cxvwgrv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104357-cxvwgrv"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】榆树处处有之，树之白皮入药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122104358-neb3dmp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104358-neb3dmp"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘性平，滑利，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122104359-uh8nq7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104359-uh8nq7e"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】榆白皮为泄滞去着，利水消肿要药，主大小便不通，利五淋，渗湿热，治肠胃邪热，水肿，痈肿，外敷疗癣湿，头疮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122104402-jlh7fc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104402-jlh7fc8"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗肠胃邪热气，消肿，治小儿头疮痂疕。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122104404-5pcbbvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104404-5pcbbvg"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】滑胎，利五淋，治喘疗不眠。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122104405-ir2yarm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104405-ir2yarm"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】通经脉，捣涎傅癣疮。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122104407-nfvhxq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104407-nfvhxq8"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【孟铣】生皮捣和三年醋泡封，暴患赤肿，女人妒乳肿，日六七易效。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122104408-qdlsiy4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104408-qdlsiy4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通二三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122104409-rd490ul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104409-rd490ul"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】此能利窍渗湿热，去有形之积，气盛而壅者宜之，若胃寒而虚者，久服恐泄真气。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122104353-fwdjy3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104353-fwdjy3r"}},{"ID":"20240122104416-6ia4w0g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104416-6ia4w0g"}},{"ID":"20240122104416-8m65mk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104416-8m65mk9"}},{"ID":"20240122104416-x321wv0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104416-x321wv0","updated":"20240130091952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第99味药，榆皮。又叫做榆白皮，就是榆树把它的皮扒开把里面白色的东西拿出来，叫榆白皮。那到处都有，这个也是很普遍哈，取白的皮入药，专治利水道，一样，利水道，除邪气，是利水消肿的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240122104417-cho69k0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104417-cho69k0","updated":"20240130092029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当你在开处方的时候，它是性，味甘性平，无毒。老师，我开了茯苓，我可不可以用榆皮？当然可以啊，可以放在一起，那这两味药，你说老师这两个药都是利水，有没有冲突？不会冲突，那，如果，我们硬要去说这个差别在那里，你可以看，中医中药可以以意得。如果这个人呢，是皮肤上全是水肿，整个皮上面都是肿的，是皮水，啊，你使用榆白皮可能会比茯苓来得好，但是如果是肚子鼓胀恰恰是因为脾脏功能不好的，你用茯苓会比榆白皮好。这样想就可以了。"}]},{"ID":"20240122104425-7w9qy96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104425-7w9qy96","updated":"20240130092413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们还有什么五皮饮嘛，各种生姜皮啊什么茯苓皮，各种药的皮把它放到一起煮。能够利水，主治，利水消肿的要药，排水的药。那很多呢，像是排水的药。身体里面有积水的时候水排不掉至喘，一般来说，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"全身性的水肿的时候，因为毛孔呼吸不是很好，这个时候因为积水了嘛，只有靠肺来呼吸，病人都会走两步就会喘得厉害"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们有很好的药，一吃下去，全身，哇，那个散出来，可以两三个礼拜瘦掉二三十磅。为什么，因为水积在里面排掉了嘛，好，水都排掉了。中药绝对是正确的，诸位记得将来你们临床的时候一定要晓得中药是最正确的，只是看你怎么用而已。"}]},{"ID":"20240130092415-rvkdl9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130092415-rvkdl9i"}}]}